  "proposal": {
    "cover_letter": "Dear Magnolia Professional Center,\n\nThank you for the opportunity to provide janitorial service for Building A. This proposal covers five visits per week across the building\u2019s two floors.\n\nThe service includes routine cleaning for the main lobby, offices, open office, corridors and stairs, conference rooms, break room, and four restrooms. Work includes routine care of the listed carpet and hard-surface floors, along with the area-specific cleaning tasks below.\n\nPlease review the pricing summary below. We appreciate your consideration and look forward to supporting a clean and welcoming environment at Magnolia Professional Center.",
    "scope_of_work": [
      "Restrooms: Clean and disinfect restroom fixtures, sinks, counters, and other touchpoints; clean mirrors; and tidy the restroom areas.",
      "Offices: Dust and wipe accessible surfaces and touchpoints in the Floor 1 offices and Floor 2 open office; vacuum carpeted areas.",
      "Floors: Vacuum carpet in the conference rooms; sweep and damp-mop hard-surface floors in the main lobby, corridors and stairs, and break room.",
